{
  "FC20_label_type_report": {
    "conclusion": "Only 'm' carries an explicit, producer-constructed group structure readable without invention (m in Z/18Z via the CRT/pullback construction actually executed in roof_rows()). t2_index and k3_index are certificate-list positions with no group law attached by the producer, so per task instruction they are excluded from the coset judgment (not judged; would require inventing structure).",
    "description": "Per-t roof-row generation label emitted by the producer's roof_rows() (search/vnbit_compact_mainrun_v3.py:roof_rows for the F=3 families, search/escape2_producer_v1.py:roof_rows for support_two_orbit). Same 324 roof rows are shared by all four F=3 families; support_two_orbit uses its own (structurally identical) roof_rows() with the same field names except t2_m_mod9/k3_m_mod6 (recomputed here as m%9/m%6 since escape2_producer_v1's roof_rows() does not carry those two fields explicitly, only m/t2_index/k3_index).",
    "fields": {
      "K9_preimage_count": "int, always 3 for every row (verified fixed at roof construction) -- constant, not a label coordinate.",
      "k3_index": "0..11, Python enumerate() index into the K3.v1.json certificate's shadows list. Same as t2_index: certificate list order, no producer-defined group law.",
      "k_mod3": "int, (kernel_cert.k of the K3 shadow) mod 3 -- a derived scalar, not used as a group coordinate anywhere in roof_rows/templates beyond the m%3 gluing check.",
      "m": "integer 0..17, unique CRT-style lift with m%9==t2_entry['m'] and m%6==k3_entry['m']. EXPLICIT producer-native group structure: by construction m is the unique representative of an element of the pullback subgroup {(a,b) in Z/9 x Z/6 : a==b mod 3} <= Z/9 x Z/6, which (order 18, containing an element of order 18) is isomorphic to Z/18Z, with t2_m_mod9 = m mod 9 and k3_m_mod6 = m mod 6 the two natural quotient maps. Used as this value directly (as an exponent 2m+1, m, -m) downstream in relation_symbols/aff.relation_symbols.",
      "s4_f_word / k3_f_word / k3_word_parity": "free-group words / parity tuples identifying the S4/K3 certificate entries; no group structure exposed at this label layer (any group structure lives inside S4/K3 certs themselves, not in the roof-row label).",
      "t2_index": "0..53, Python enumerate() index into the S4.v2.json certificate's generation_detail list (filtered to pass==True). NO group structure is defined on this index by the producer -- it is certificate list order, not a group element."
    }
  },
